# Task 145-019 Execution Plan — Runtime Extension Prototype (Opsiyon B Watcher Daemon)

## Approach
1. Create `src/orchestra/timeout-watcher.ts` (~250 LoC) with TimeoutWatcher class
2. Add TIMEOUT_EXTEND channel to event-stream.ts CHANNELS
3. Write comprehensive tests in `tests/orchestra/timeout-watcher.test.ts` (8+ tests)
4. Wire into task-router.ts with default-off config check

## Key Design Decisions
- TimeoutConfig and DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_CONFIG don't exist yet (Task 2/10 deps not merged)
- Will define a minimal local config interface `TimeoutWatcherConfig` within timeout-watcher.ts
- loadConfig() will read from .deckent/config.json directly (standard Deckent pattern)
- checkProgress reads .tasks/<taskId>.hb heartbeat files + runs git diff --stat
- Extension limit: hard-capped at 2 (fail-safe, config-independent)
- Default: runtime_extension_enabled = false

